COMMENT     PROVISIONAL REFSEQ: This record has not yet been subject to final
            NCBI review. The reference sequence was derived from M14707.
            There are polypyrimidine tracts at positions 98 to 137 and 712 to
            720.  This sequence supersedes several previously published partial
            sequences of the hepatitis A virus wild type virus.  These partial
            genomic sequences are found under accession numbers K00386, M14114
            and M14115.
            Draft entry and computer-readable copy of sequence in [1] kindly
            provided by J.I.Cohen, 05-AUG-1987.
            COMPLETENESS: full length.
